//
// This revision keeps the same overall design: open a constrained span quickly,
// then repeatedly either close it when the SQL prefix is complete or extend it
// with ConstrainedSymbol so the parser drives schema-valid SQL growth.
//
// The verification fixes are minimal. First, we guard the ConstrainedSymbol call
